WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Six coding agents, one kitchen: working, idle, blocked, plated.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[b] Jump straight to the cook blocked at the pass.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
[Tab] Walk the stations: state, workspace, time in state.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[Esc ?] Every key in one place. Nothing here controls an agent.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
[Esc R] Recap the service: observed time blocked, computed locally.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[R w] Focus one workspace; a returns to all of them.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
[a f] Open the walk-in freezer, where ended sessions rest.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Esc] Back to the kitchen. Read-only and localhost-only.
